To elaborate on this, you can also identify the scroll of identify by
stashing unidentified scrolls. Since the scroll of identify is by far
the most common found, the one appearing most often in your inventory
will have a big chance of being a scroll of identify.

Just for those who want to know the (probably still) exact nubers, here
is the table from version 7.00 of the spoilers (you can ftp them from
altair.krl.caltech.edu):

